==== delta'(Q),  u_Q = X+1 ====
  delta'_1(Q) = u/(u - 1)     [sqfree] ($.1)($.1 - 1)
  delta'_2(Q) = v/(v - 1)     [sqfree] ($.2)($.2 - 1)
  delta'_3(Q) = (u + v + 1)/(u + v + 2)     [sqfree] ($.1 + $.2 + 1)($.1 + $.2 + 2)
  delta'_K(Q) = X + 1

